{"data": [{"author_id": "2098305275229081600", "created_at": "2026-11-04T06:20:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117864622204318181"], "id": "2117864622204318181", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 344, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "炒美股可以用么？ https://t.co/9Nv08cv4h8", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2117…", "end": 32, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2117863209826934784", "start": 9, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2117863209826934784", "url": "https://t.co/9Nv08cv4h8"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/Dlife2026/status/2117864622204318181"}, {"author_id": "2005491272530984961", "created_at": "2026-11-05T06:23:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118227562341998960"], "id": "2118227562341998960", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 181, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🎉直播万圣节活动发奖结果公布\n\n感谢大家参与本次活动，恭喜以下用户获奖：\n🎁 福利一（部分名单）\n山顶传媒思豫 · 山顶传媒大空头 · feysel boss · Unoshi · 四方喜財7268 · 晚晚皆安2 · 天噵 ·  Denisakapratama · BUY_and_SELL · 清风月\n\n💰 福利二\n凉拌杀手2 · 币大师稳健持币 · 毅博说币 · 米粒Ml https://t.co/xiPvyxkTdt", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/xiPvyxkTdt", "end": 213, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Gate_Livezh/status/2118227562341998960/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118182425843130368", "start": 190, "url": "https://t.co/xiPvyxkTdt"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/Gate_Livezh/status/2118227562341998960"}, {"author_id": "1916622377414475776", "created_at": "2026-11-04T07:52:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117887692042338561"], "id": "2117887692042338561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 732, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📈 金融交易的魔力②：预测的幻觉\n\n炒股很多年以后，我发现一个特别有意思的现象：\n\n几乎所有已经走完的股票行情，都有人能给你解释得明明白白。\n\n一个技术派打开MACD、均线，告诉你哪里是金叉，哪里是死叉。\n\n一个波浪理论高手，能画出完整的五浪结构。\n\n一个缠论大师，能找到中枢、背驰和买卖点。 https://t.co/8aqHutM7jE https://t.co/iob1Hlmo7L", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8aqHutM7jE", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ChinaTaxTruth/status/2117887692042338561/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117887679132209152", "start": 147, "url": "https://t.co/8aqHutM7jE"}, {"display_url": "x.com/chinataxtruth/…", "end": 194, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/chinataxtruth/status/2117162391431749832", "start": 171, "url": "https://t.co/iob1Hlmo7L"}]}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117162391431749832", "type": "quoted"}], "url": "https://x.com/ChinaTaxTruth/status/2117887692042338561"}, {"author_id": "1951454477267116032", "created_at": "2026-11-05T06:30:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118229333193998355"], "id": "2118229333193998355", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 1361, "like_count": 13, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "讲一九四二年河南大饥荒的书和文章，差不多都要引一句话：\"水旱蝗汤，河南四荒。\"水是水灾，旱是旱灾，蝗是蝗虫，汤是汤恩伯，当时驻在河南的国军大将。二〇一〇年人民出版社出过一本讲这场饥荒的书，书名就叫《水旱蝗汤悲歌》。 https://t.co/EZFPiFOOs7", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/EZFPiFOOs7", "end": 131, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/wangdefapodcast/status/2118229333193998355/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118229329901441025", "start": 108, "url": "https://t.co/EZFPiFOOs7"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/wangdefapodcast/status/2118229333193998355"}, {"author_id": "1675569553764659200", "created_at": "2026-11-05T09:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118279655568572647"], "id": "2118279655568572647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2013, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "蜀汉亡国那天，最挨骂的人是谯周\n成都朝堂上，刘禅问：魏军到了，怎么办？\n有人说逃去东吴，有人说南逃南中\n谯周说：都行不通，降魏吧\n他算的账很冷：东吴也是大国，去了照样称臣，还得受二茬辱；南中是蛮夷之地，去了必反\n不如一次到位，降魏，换全城百姓平安", "url": "https://x.com/zhangxianh0725/status/2118279655568572647"}, {"author_id": "702134511417430017", "created_at": "2026-11-05T07:06:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118238457726472597"], "id": "2118238457726472597", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1521, "impression_count": 71818, "like_count": 731, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 202}, "text": "https://t.co/rlSEMaCHFM", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2118…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2118235596913291264", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2118235596913291264", "url": "https://t.co/rlSEMaCHFM"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/BtcTraderax/status/2118238457726472597"}, {"author_id": "1639022572418236417", "created_at": "2026-11-05T02:31:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118169217145143725"], "id": "2118169217145143725", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 39042, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：https://t.co/EEAdCsBVn4\n\n【732】《囤货，然后活下去》by：阿拉贡夫人\n【243】《求生：安全屋是魔法学院》by：梨蓝蓝\n【1896】《大瑛弟国》by：三千世\n【314】《（足球）足坛人生模拟器》by：奶油泡泡\n【58】《朕的臣子们都古穿今了》by：月半时", "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "迅雷云盘", "display_url": "pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5ZO_1_l0Jx…", "end": 46, "expanded_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5ZO_1_l0JxvE8Ud6Sozm_HA1?pwd=h4gn", "start": 23, "status": 200, "title": "迅雷", "unwound_url": "https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP5ZO_1_l0JxvE8Ud6Sozm_HA1?pwd=h4gn", "url": "https://t.co/EEAdCsBVn4"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/plpam23187146/status/2118169217145143725"}, {"author_id": "1706245213411557376", "created_at": "2026-11-04T07:51:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117887320099577996"], "id": "2117887320099577996", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 197, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "为什么现在刘禅的风评越来越好了？\n\n其实，把诸葛亮的《出师表》翻译成大白话，你就明白了。\n\n诸葛亮对刘禅说：\n\n孩子，你爹走得早，临终前把你托付给了我。我这次要带着赵云、魏延、吴懿他们出去干一票大的，去收拾曹魏，实现你爹兴复汉室的遗愿。\n\n至于什么时候回来，我也不知道。", "url": "https://x.com/JDveif/status/2117887320099577996"}, {"author_id": "1861557563667685378", "created_at": "2026-11-05T07:12:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118239957177467167"], "id": "2118239957177467167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个有意思的佛教历史人物，“三车和尚”，唐代玄奘大师的弟子、法相唯识宗的重要祖师窥基大师（公元632—682年）。\n\n玄奘西行取经途中，遇见一位入定千年的老修行，劝他转世投胎，后来这位老修行投生尉迟将军家，成为窥基和尚的故事。\n\n出处：《百日禅》〈三车祖师——窥基法师〉\n讲述者：宣化上人", "url": "https://x.com/Meditationofnon/status/2118239957177467167"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:26:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118319134966780262"], "id": "2118319134966780262", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论社区第四期操盘手训练营学员学习总结，缠论交易最终比的是人本身，就像乾坤大挪移的第八重肯定打不过第九重，但任何非乾坤大挪移的，肯定打不过第八重，不可能所有人都相信应用缠论系统，因此那些不用缠论的人，就成了缠论吸血的对象~ https://t.co/jkwbNzBv5B", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/jkwbNzBv5B", "end": 135, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2118319134966780262/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118319063848083456", "start": 112, "url": "https://t.co/jkwbNzBv5B"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/jkwbNzBv5B", "end": 135, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2118319134966780262/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118319092340019201", "start": 112, "url": "https://t.co/jkwbNzBv5B"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2118319134966780262"}, {"author_id": "1861557563667685378", "created_at": "2026-11-04T18:53:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118054159773749622"], "id": "2118054159773749622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 58, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《心经》中有一句极其重要的话：\n三世诸佛，依般若波罗蜜多故，得阿耨多罗三藐三菩提。\n这句话可以说是整部《心经》的核心结论之一。\n它揭示了一个非常深刻的问题：\n过去、现在、未来一切诸佛，究竟依靠什么而成佛？", "url": "https://x.com/Meditationofnon/status/2118054159773749622"}, {"author_id": "1935911364268376071", "created_at": "2026-11-05T00:23:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118137123077579244"], "id": "2118137123077579244", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 752, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "一个偷拳的农家子，把一门拳法送进了一亿人的身体》\n十九世纪初，河南温县陈家沟。\n一个姓杨的年轻人，第三次来到这个村子，要拜师学拳。\n他叫杨露禅，家里穷，早年给陈家沟的拳师陈长兴家做雇工，干活的同时，趴在墙头、躲在暗处，偷偷看陈家人练拳。\n\"偷拳\"这个细节，是后世小说的演绎。 https://t.co/158VrJy1el", "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/158VrJy1el", "end": 161, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/gpsma2025/status/2118137123077579244/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118135878648537088", "start": 138, "url": "https://t.co/158VrJy1el"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/gpsma2025/status/2118137123077579244"}, {"author_id": "1592938896161001472", "created_at": "2026-11-04T00:41:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117779201055228331"], "id": "2117779201055228331", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析11.04 https://t.co/9fvIh1PILV 来自 @YouTube", "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 57, "id": "10228272", "start": 49, "username": "YouTube"}], "urls": [{"description": "-币安广场/微博：高山说缠论-专注缠论交易系统教学多年-专注币圈/股票/黄金/原油实战操作-周一至周五早8点缠论解析早课-每周...", "display_url": "youtu.be/6i4pK96EzPA?si…", "end": 45, "expanded_url": "https://youtu.be/6i4pK96EzPA?si=1Fy7Py3Y6_pFFYzQ", "images": [{"height": 360, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117779205203353600/wOs3VRuz?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 480}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117779205203353600/wOs3VRuz?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 22, "status": 200, "title": "《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析11.04", "unwound_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=1Fy7Py3Y6_pFFYzQ&v=6i4pK96EzPA&feature=youtu.be", "url": "https://t.co/9fvIh1PILV"}]}, "url": "https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2117779201055228331"}, {"author_id": "1814255253258399744", "created_at": "2026-11-05T09:47:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids"